{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e88e05641a4b57a58b7e49b68be444a07e634ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x+\\cos x=1/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31cc5034677b08089f8403dae430e1e070fed23e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x&lt;\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d89357bdd19795ccb9fd53b8528e215d4aa860c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan x$\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/798fe3e64500d5799947894e6991a66a9f650c0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-\\frac{4}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-\\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\frac{4}{3}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{not completely determined by the given information}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"413\" height=\"55\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Squaring the equation, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1fe0d4477389dd2606f02659c08e63bbedcbbe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin ^2 x + \\cos ^2 x + 2 \\sin x \\cos x = \\frac{1}{25} =\\Rrightarrow 2\\sin x \\cos x = -\\frac{24}{25} \\Rrightarrow \\sin x \\cos x = -\\frac{12}{25}\\]\" width=\"605\" height=\"37\" />\nRecall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a71d61edeebb423f43ab2d3cf812c5ee973d1ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)^2 = (a+b)^2 - 4ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"19\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5fa134a4807a34a2c7d66a9e7bc1b812ade1bde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\sin x - \\cos x)^2 = (\\sin x + \\cos x)^2 - 4 \\sin x \\cos x\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd276b8295fa79ba386e1b0633f50d87edb72b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\sin x - \\cos x)^2 = \\frac{1}{25} - 4 (- \\frac{12}{25})\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1187ddab8728f51f3b112ea3d2cac96d70be4fc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\sin x - \\cos x) = \\frac{7}{5}\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"37\" />\nWe can now solve for the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e8f3a072de64627a11a2df663e577eb43d60c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11f986c49f29d7a2ed4c28cab7319fa2ee3ee978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x$\" width=\"37\" height=\"8\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/21205e12e1631ca98e03493e275e714f909a2148.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin x + \\cos x = \\frac{1}{5}\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed952606f3fea55ed8e87a6de4b4a7e0d7450170.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin x - \\cos x = \\frac{7}{5}\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69a27d953e10f58d40249371ed57f892b21b021a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\sin x = \\frac{8}{5} \\Rrightarrow \\sin x = \\frac{4}{5}, \\cos x = -\\frac{3}{5}\\]\" width=\"281\" height=\"37\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58ab4613466977ff90d5eefcb897b916c1b07256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan x = \\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d1fc224a5744ebcf5df40031a04b63679368da9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan x = \\frac{\\frac{4}{5}}{-\\frac{3}{5}} = -\\frac{4}{3}\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<b